#  booking api

# api call for listing

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/appointments/
Accept: application/json

# api call for adding

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/appointments/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patient_name":"abhi",
    "phone":"12345678",
    "doctor":2,
    "appointment_date":"2026-10-10",
    "problem":"sick"


}


